file crates/platform/src/script.rs
symbol run_line
lines 0 87
hash 6dfca5d3c09dc33f
note One line. Input commands write the Input directly - mouse moves the pointer, down presses and holds the left button (twice makes it a double click, carried on the press since that is the frame the app sees it on) with the modifiers named after it, up releases it, wheel adds to the vertical wheel, swipe dx dy to both axes as a trackpad would, pinch n adds a pinch of n percent, key pushes a Press, text appends typed text - and all but mouse yield, so each is a frame of its own. wait and pause yield for their duration, and pause also adds its length to the script's clock at once. click, dblclick and drag queue their expansion; the -id forms aim first; absent checks an element is not in view. quit ends the run. Anything else goes to the app.

