hash 5bb18665248eac03
note click-id, dblclick-id and hover-id: ask the app where the named element was last frame and queue the plain gesture at its centre. An element that was not drawn, or whose centre lies outside the area it shows in, is refused with a script error instead of a gesture at a point where something else is; the test harness fails the scenario on it.

