file crates/platform/src/script.rs
symbol step_script
lines 0 30
hash da7829dcfcf27875
note Runs before every frame of a scripted run. While a pause is still waiting out its wall-clock time it returns at once; otherwise the clock advances by one frame, a pending wait consumes one and returns, and otherwise the pointer's modifiers are reset to the real ones and lines run until one yields a frame or quits. It returns whether the script asked to quit.

